  "ID": "39071",
  "post_title": "Poemas de Javi Aguilella ilustran el nuevo catálogo de Cerámicas Peronda",
  "post_date": "2013-07-18 10:20:46",
  "post_name": "poemas-de-javi-aguilella-ilustran-el-nuevo-catalogo-de-ceramicas-peronda",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Economía|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>Peronda vuelve a sorprender con la introducci&oacute;n de poemas en el nuevo cat&aacute;logo del producto Museum, la colecci&oacute;n de azulejos m&aacute;s ambiciosa de esta empresa.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/07/AaguilellaJaviRosPeris1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /><br />\n El due&ntilde;o de estas palabras ha sido el poeta de Onda Javi Aguilella (en la foto junto a Ros Peris, directora de marketing de Peronda), que ha querido plasmar en poetas originales para esta ocasi&oacute;n la naturaleza humana y los sentimientos que puede inspirar el brillo especular de la colecci&oacute;n Museum.<br />\n De esta manera, Javi Aguilella se une a la Fashion Lab, donde <a href=\"http://www.peronda.com/\" target=\"_blank\">la empresa azulejera Peronda</a> colabora con artistas de diferentes disciplinas.<br />\n &nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/javiaguilellamuseumperonda/aaguilellajavirosperis1.jpg\" alt=\"aaguilellajavirosperis1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/javiaguilellamuseumperonda/aaguilellajavirosperis2.jpg\" alt=\"aaguilellajavirosperis2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/javiaguilellamuseumperonda/agatha-fontaine_amb.jpg\" alt=\"Imagen 28982\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/javiaguilellamuseumperonda/agatha-fontaine_det1.jpg\" alt=\"Imagen 29085\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/javiaguilellamuseumperonda/agatha-fontaine_det2.jpg\" alt=\"Imagen 29029\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/javiaguilellamuseumperonda/agatha_amb.jpg\" alt=\"agatha_amb\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/javiaguilellamuseumperonda/ambar-ros-audrey_det.jpg\" alt=\"Foto 3393\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/javiaguilellamuseumperonda/ambar_amb.jpg\" alt=\"Foto 2983\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/javiaguilellamuseumperonda/ambar_art_amb.jpg\" alt=\"Foto 3023\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/javiaguilellamuseumperonda/ambar_audrey_amb.jpg\" alt=\"Foto 3408\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/javiaguilellamuseumperonda/ambar_det.jpg\" alt=\"Foto 2988\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/javiaguilellamuseumperonda/art_amb.jpg\" alt=\"art_amb\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/javiaguilellamuseumperonda/auris-aston_amb.jpg\" alt=\"auris-aston_amb\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/javiaguilellamuseumperonda/auris-aston_amb0.jpg\" alt=\"auris-aston_amb0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/javiaguilellamuseumperonda/auris-aston_det0.jpg\" alt=\"auris-aston_det0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/javiaguilellamuseumperonda/auris-aston_det1.jpg\" alt=\"auris-aston_det1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/javiaguilellamuseumperonda/auris-aston_det2.jpg\" alt=\"auris-aston_det2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4